chlorine wrote:
> My question is: how do I get the monsters?

Several possibilities spring to mind for a vanilla game:

1- Vault guards. If you are tough enough to take on a vault guard, they
can be generated in limitless quantities by hanging out in emptied
vaults. Simply refuse to do as he asks, throw abuse at him when he asks
your name, and eventually he'll turn nasty. Vault guards will drop some
nice armour for you, but be aware of the consequences of sacrificing
human corpses. Once the guard is dead, the vault walls heal up, so be
sure to have a means of digging or teleport handy.
2- Shrieker abuse. Get a shrieker. Poke it with a thoroughly rusty -5
orcish short sword until it shrieks. Every ten shrieks (on average)
generates one monster. Heal the shrieker (or allow it to heal) as
necessary.
3- Pudding farming. Get yourself a brown/black pudding, or at least a
corpse of one with a wand of undead turning. Consult one of the many
"how-to" threads/spoilers on pudding farming.
4- Nymph summoning. Get a bell. Curse it. Ring it. A nymph will appear
for you to kill. Repeat until bored. Sadly, I don't think nymphs
generated this way carry the normal nymphy items.

If you were playing slashem, I'd have a few more suggestions for you.



